Inline/
scratch/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Distillation runtime artifacts (defense in depth — these should always live
# in ~/.nira/, never inside the source tree, but we ignore them here in
# case NIRA_HOME is misconfigured during dev)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.nira/
learning.db
**/learning/sessions/
**/learning/pending_review/
**/learning/benchmarks/
**/teacher_traces/
*.session.json

# Local dev artifacts (hybrid worker logs + cli debug dumps)
minion_logs/
*.oj-debug.json
oj-debug.*.json

# tsc incremental state. Committing it shares stale build info between
# checkouts, which silently skips re-checking files and hides type errors
# until something unrelated invalidates the cache.
frontend/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Build artefacts the site hands out. The apk is 42 MB, is regenerated by
# `./gradlew :app:assembleDebug`, and would be stale in the repository the
# day after it was committed. The page is built to cope with the directory
# being empty: it asks the server what is there and renders a card saying
# the build is missing, with the command that produces it.
website/public/downloads/*
!website/public/downloads/.gitkeep
